Example output:
{"critique": "The user asks whether processing or shipment ends cancellation eligibility. The reply distinguishes placed, processing and shipped stages, preserving the policy citation and relevant return alternative. Although detailed and partly restated, the distinctions directly resolve the expressed confusion; length and repeated wording alone do not establish irrelevant detail.", "result": "Pass"}
